    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Welcome to the Lucis Garden Game. \nThe objective of this game is to plant
    seeds and nurture them.\nYou can teleport to the Teleport Pads lined in front
    of the plots by aiming your hand or the ray at then and pressing the trigger.
    You can also grab certain objects to help you grow your farm.\nThe simple gameplay
    loop is water the plot --> add soil to the plot --> plant the seeds in said plot
    --> watch your plant grow! Press the back/return button to close/open the tutorial 
    menu or hold it to return to the Main Menu."
